b17f1550bcf38\" href=\"?note=814b17f1550bcf38\" title=\"27-df-monodnf\">27-df-monodnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.2.3 Definition 7.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f210bb4dac8635d3\" href=\"?note=f210bb4dac8635d3\" title=\"Shellable and weakly shellable positive functions\">Shellable and weakly shellable positive functions</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"335"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"359"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"71326b2cdccfdfb4\" href=\"?note=71326b2cdccfdfb4\" title=\"27-df-shellable\">27-df-shellable</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"814b17f1550bcf38\" href=\"?note=814b17f1550bcf38\" title=\"27-df-monodnf\">27-df-monodnf</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a> 的 DNF 求值函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ShellableFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n:\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\in\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ShellableFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n:\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\in\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakShellFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n:\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n\\cap\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WeakShellFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n:\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{ShellableDNF}_n\\cap\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>shellable function 要求完整素项 DNF 可壳化；weakly shellable 允许选择别的正 DNF 表示。两个性质的区别是后者在正函数上普遍成立，不能把它视为强结构限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-shellable","status":"resolved","id":"71326b2cdccfdfb4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":